          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M8",
            "speaker_id": 100996,
            "reply_to": "M4",
            "text": "For scope, the plan covers the main open office, the two new meeting rooms that need drywall, plus the pantry and restrooms for new finishes and tiling.",
