            "speaker_id": 100996,
            "reply_to": "M22",
            "text": "For A3, the form is good. We need to decide who is responsible for it and when it gets done each day. To make T9 effective, it has to be consistent. I propose the first person to arrive on site completes it before any power tools are started.",
