        "thread_goal": "Run post-project review and lock improvement actions for next floors.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M68",
            "speaker_id": 100996,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, we've completed the pilot floor renovation. Great work everyone. Now it's time for the post-project review for T12. Let's use this thread to capture lessons learned and suggestions for the next floors. What worked well? What could be better?",
            "mentions": [
              83191,
              262009,
              262702,
              334628
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T12"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "tada",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M69",
            "speaker_id": 262702,
            "reply_to": "M68",
            "text": "What worked well: The standard work checklist (A2) was a huge success. Having the photo-proof step for surface prep caught two potential issues before they became rework. The daily progress log (A5) also kept us all on the same page.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2",
              "A5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "heavy_check_mark",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M70",
            "speaker_id": 262009,
            "reply_to": "M68",
            "text": "The staggered material delivery was great. It kept the site much cleaner and safer than having everything arrive at once. We should definitely do that again. The dedicated storage room also helped a lot.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M71",
            "speaker_id": 262702,
            "reply_to": "M69",
            "text": "What could be better: Our initial material list was missing a few small things, like the leveling compound. For the next floor, we should do a more detailed survey (T1) and have a small contingency budget/stock for unexpected items.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M72",
            "speaker_id": 83191,
            "reply_to": "M68",
            "text": "The checklist A2 was helpful but it took a long time to fill out at first. Maybe we can make a shorter version for simple rooms?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M73",
            "speaker_id": 100996,
            "reply_to": "M72",
            "text": "That's a fair point. We need to keep the quality checks, but maybe we can streamline the format. Let's make that an action for T8 refinement: review A2 to see if any steps can be combined without losing the quality control.",
            "mentions": [
              83191
